:: OC Levi and Carter [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are chilling, sitting on a bench to catch your breath, when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suddenly sees a familiar face running by and jumps to his feet. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hey! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span>!”</span> You turn to see the boy you had spotted jogging on the street before. He is once again jogging, looking rather bored, <span style="color:LightGreen">until he sees <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and suddenly lights up like a lamp.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                State: {
                    Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Levi",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                    Blush: 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>! H- hey!”</span> He stops in his tracks, his face turning a soft shade of pink as he smiles widely, greeting the much smaller boy. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“H- how are you? What are you doing?”</span> You notice how instant his voice and demeanor change from the first time you spoke with him. <span style="color:LightGreen">His stoic and uninterested vibe completely changes to that of a little kid whose best friend just came over to play. It is quite adorable to see the much bigger kid melt at the presence of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Me and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span> are hanging out. I see you’re training, as always.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> to blush even deeper. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You know <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span>, right <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span>?”</span> You nod, explaining your first meeting. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs again as you mention that he was also jogging then. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Haha, makes sense. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> is a true hero, always training for battle or to help others! I don’t know how he does it.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- it’s nothing…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> <span style="color:Pink">embarrassingly rubs the back of his head, though looks overjoyed to be praised,</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I like exercising. Plus, it means I can help out whenever you need it.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> is super strong! The other weekend, I was helping an old lady on my street move some old stuff out of her house to clear it up. That stuff was SUPER heavy, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> stopped by and moved the stuff like it was nothing! He has, like, superstrength or something! Hey, did you want to hang out with us? We were going to look around to see if we could find anyone in need!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> nods happily at this, <span style="color:LightGreen">instantly turning into a little kid ready to play!</span> <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    The three of you set out, looking for anyone in need or any crime that must be stopped! It doesn’t take you long to come across something, a vile act having been committed! <span style="color:Yellow">Someone had dumped a handful of garbage bags on the side of the road, not even 30 feet from a dumpster!</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sighs at this <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Evil doers truly have no shame.”</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I wish they were here so we could pound them!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> says, smacking his fist into his hand. You all walk over to clean up the mess. Curiously, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, the smallest of the trio, instantly grabs for the largest, heaviest bag. <span style="color:Pink">His desire to be a hero seems to have caused him to overestimate his own strength, something that happens a lot, and he quickly learns as he struggles to even lift it a few inches off the ground. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span>, meanwhile, watches with wide-eyed awe as if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is the coolest and most heroic person he’s ever seen.</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I… got… it!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> struggles before quickly proving his own lack of strength as he drops the bag right on his foot, <span style="color:Yellow">causing him to stumble back and trip headfirst into a large bush!</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ow…”</span> He groans as you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> rush over to help him. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Are you alright?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> asks, pushing aside the leaves of the bush so you two can grab him. <span style="color:Pink">As expected of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s never-ending bad luck, the boy had not only landed facedown in the bush with his butt in the air, but his bottoms had been caught on a branch, causing them to be pulled to his knees and leaving the entire back design of his $CarterUndies.Name exposed to you both. You can’t help but chuckle a little as you two help him up.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                State: {
                    Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                    PantsDown: 1,
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Levi",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                    Blush: 3,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That didn’t go as planned…”</span> A blushing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says as he fixes his bottoms. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That was awesome!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> says with a big smile, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You almost had it! You’re a lot stronger than you think. Plus, I think it’s so cool tried the biggest one first!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">The boy seems completely impressed and still in awe of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, despite the fact that he just saw the boy’s underwear-clad butt up close. Even <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> starts to seem a little embarrassed by the praise as you all take the trash to the dumpster.</span> <br>
    <br>
    Still, it’s pretty cute to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> having a boy who looks up to him so much. Plus, seeing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> acting like this is pretty endearing. You both say goodbye once you’ve finished, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Levi</span> having to return to his work out. <span style="color:LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems to be in an extra-good mood after that.</span> <br>
    <<needChange "Fun" 20>>
    <span style="color:green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
    <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 15>>
    <span style="color:red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
    <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 15>>
